  "description": "Entry, identity choice, completion and abandonment for the first-run flow \u2014 the board that answers whether the app is losing people before it has shown them anything.\n\nBuilt from `onboarding.*` in `docs/practices/app-events.md`. Every query here is held to the `logEvent` call sites by `DashboardQueryContractTest`.\n\n**Delivery is at-least-once.** A record can rarely ship twice (the export was acknowledged and the process died before the disk buffer's delete), so read raw counts as approximate. Panels that count *installs* or *sessions* are immune by construction \u2014 a duplicate lands in the same series and collapses.\n\n**Sampling is per session.** `telemetry.appEventsSampleRate` hashes the session id, so a sampled-out session contributes nothing at all rather than losing the middle of a funnel. Below 1.0 every absolute count here is that fraction of reality; every ratio is unaffected.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 130,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Does anyone get through?",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "grafanacloud-logs"
      },
      "description": "Distinct installs with at least one `onboarding.step_viewed`. The top of the funnel and the denominator for both rates beside it.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 131,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "grafanacloud-logs"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "count(count by (install_id) (count_over_time({service_name=\"opson-client\", deployment_environment=\"$env\"} | event_name=\"onboarding.step_viewed\" [$__range])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Installs entering onboarding",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "mixed",
        "uid": "-- Mixed --"
      },
      "description": "Installs reaching `onboarding.completed` over installs that entered. Per install, not per event, so a re-entered flow does not inflate it.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 1,
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 132,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "grafanacloud-logs"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "count(count by (install_id) (count_over_time({service_name=\"opson-client\", deployment_environment=\"$env\"} | event_name=\"onboarding.completed\" [$__range])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "instant"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "grafanacloud-logs"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "count(count by (install_id) (count_over_time({service_name=\"opson-client\", deployment_environment=\"$env\"} | event_name=\"onboarding.step_viewed\" [$__range])))",
          "refId": "B",
          "queryType": "instant"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "__expr__",
            "uid": "__expr__"
          },
          "expression": "($A / $B) * 100",
          "refId": "C",
          "type": "math"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Completion rate",
      "type": "stat",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "filterByRefId",
          "options": {
            "include": "C"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "mixed",
        "uid": "-- Mixed --"
      },
      "description": "Installs reaching `onboarding.abandoned` over installs that entered.\n\n`onboarding.abandoned` is emitted from `onCleared`, so a process kill never reaches it. Completion + abandon does not sum to 100, and the gap is the people the OS took.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 1,
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 133,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "grafanacloud-logs"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "count(count by (install_id) (count_over_time({service_name=\"opson-client\", deployment_environment=\"$env\"} | event_name=\"onboarding.abandoned\" [$__range])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "instant"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "grafanacloud-logs"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "count(count by (install_id) (count_over_time({service_name=\"opson-client\", deployment_environment=\"$env\"} | event_name=\"onboarding.step_viewed\" [$__range])))",
          "refId": "B",
          "queryType": "instant"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "__expr__",
            "uid": "__expr__"
          },
          "expression": "($A / $B) * 100",
          "refId": "C",
          "type": "math"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Abandon rate",
      "type": "stat",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "filterByRefId",
          "options": {
            "include": "C"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "grafanacloud-logs"
      },
      "description": "`onboarding.completed` with `account_ready=false`: the user is on Today and guest creation did not land in time. They are not signed in and nothing on Today says so.\n\nAnything but zero here deserves a look.",
